Reverses the pgTAP edits that came with 20261016000200 (commit 141c99c: members read only their own profiles, follows and comments directly), so the
rollback check can run the 0001-0011 files as they were before it, against a stack rolled back
past it. Applied by scripts/idempotency-rollback-check.sh to a throwaway copy; never to supabase/tests.

